se are enabled using the \\ch message command."�The bracketed area after \\ch consists of the Variable to store the choice, a default choice in case the player cancels, and then a number of choices."@If the default choice is set to 0, the player can't cancel."]The $DEBUG flag was set.  This flag is set automatically during playtesting within RMXP."{Debug mode allows you to access the Debug menu (F9 or in the pause menu), and to modify Pokémon in your party/the PC."xYou can also use hidden moves anytime, and hold CTRL to skip any battles and decide the outcome of Trainer battles.":Obtained all badges for the first and second regions."VTo add a badge, use $Trainer.badges[X]=true where X is a number from 0 through 7.">In Debug mode, you can set your badges in the Debug menu."/Press F8 to take a screenshot of the game."JThe screenshot will be put in the folder where the save file is kept."Choose a text option."V\bThis is the text of a male character. \rThis is the text of a female character."z\pgThis text is the colour of the player's gender.  \pogThis text is the colour of the opposite gender to the player."�\c[0]Default text, \c[1]blue text, \c[2]red text, \c[3] green text, \c[4]cyan text, \c[5]magenta text, \c[6] yellow text, \c[7]grey text, \c[8]white text."�<b>Bold text,</b> <i>italic text,</i> <u>underlined text,</u> <s>strikethrough text,</s> <outln>outline text,</outln> <outln2>thicker outline text.</outln2>"u<fn=Arial>Arial text,</fn> <fs=25>size 25 text,</fs> <fs=40>size 40 text,</fs> <o=128>half-transparent text.</o>"�This is a line\n break.  Text is \n<r>right-aligned until next line\n break.  Text is <ac>centred</ac> here.  Text is <ar>right-aligned</ar> here."_\PN is the player's name, \PM is the player's money, \v[12] is the content of Variable 12."!\GThe money window is shown.""\CNThe coins window is shown."]\G\CNThe money and coins windows are both shown.  The coins window must be shown second."Q\f[introBoy]The introBoy picture from the Graphics/Pictures folder is shown."f\ff[introBoy]The introBoy picture is shown again, but cropped to the top-left 96x96 pixels of it."oThis is <icon=bagPocket3> bagPocket3 from the folder Graphics/Icons.  Icons shown this way are not padded."?\w[signskin]The windowskin has changed to "signskin" here."�\l[3]This message box has 3 lines to it rather than 2, so more text can be shown at once.  Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit."'\wuThis message box is at the top."*\wmThis message box is in the middle."X\wuThis message box is\wm jumping around the screen\wd in a rather off-putting way."7\opThis message box slides on-screen at the start."6\clThis message box slides off-screen at the end."'\ts[]This text appeared instantly!"\ts[5]This text is slow."5\se[itemlevel]Sound effect itemlevel was played."BMusic effect Jingle - HMTM will be played. \me[Jingle - HMTM]"EA complete list of all message options is available on the wiki."\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."*You don't have any Pokémon with you."/\v[2] is the first Pokémon in your party."%You have a Celebi in your party."+You don't have a Celebi in your party."|\rRemember to read the wiki for further information.  An Internet shortcut to the wiki can be found in the main folder.")\PN obtained six different Pokémon."1Also received a Pokégear and Running Shoes."J\rOh...  Are you all right?  Well, you'll have better luck this time."~[This message was triggered by the "Starting Over" switch, which is currently set to true.  Now turning that switch off.]"Choose a roaming Pokémon."5Switch 53 is on.  Latias and Latios are roaming."gSwitch 53 is off.  Latias and Latios are not roaming.  Do you want to make Latias and Latios roam?"'Latias and Latios are now roaming.")Switch 54 is on.  Kyogre is roaming."PSwitch 54 is off.  Kyogre is not roaming.  Do you want to make Kyogre roam?"Kyogre is now roaming."(Switch 55 is on.  Entei is roaming."NSwitch 55 is off.  Entei is not roaming.  Do you want to m