me things about Shadow Pokémon in Essentials. However, the wiki has far more information about them." \bWhat do you want to know?"k\bShadow Pokémon are a special kind of Pokémon which appeared in Pokémon Colosseum and Pokémon XD."b\bThey can be included in Essentials as well. See the wiki for information on how to do this."]\bTrainers with Shadow Pokémon are set up in exactly the same way as any other trainer."�\bAny Poké Ball can be defined as a Snag Ball in items.txt. If $PokemonGlobal.snagMachine is TRUE, all Poké Balls will be Snag Balls automatically."�\b$Trainer.shadowcaught is an array (like the Pokédex seen/owned arrays) which keeps track of which Shadow Pokémon species have been caught."2\bYou can purify Shadow Pokémon in two ways."=\bThe first is by bringing them to the Relic Stone here."n\bThe second is by placing them in the Purify Chamber, which you can access from the PC in Poké Centers."7\bI've now given you access to the Purify Chamber."~\bThe effects of Heart Gauge-lowering items are already in Essentials. You just need to add the items themselves to items.txt."�\bI can control the weather. Which weather would you like to see?\ch[1,-1,None,Rain,Storm, Snow,Sandstorm,Sunny,HeavyRain,Blizzard]"f\bThis weather can occur even at night, and doesn't fade in/out. It's better if you don't use it."�\bNote that the weather metadata for this map is set, even though its probability is 0. This prevents the weather from lingering when you leave this map."(\bI stopped you as you walked past."�\bHaving "Trainer(2)" as my event's name, and the "Event Touch" trigger, tells me to activate whenever you enter either of the two tiles in front of me."u\bKernel.pbExclaim makes me exclaim. Kernel.pbNoticePlayer does the same thing, as well as make me approach you."�\bTrainers use these features by default, but other NPCs like me can use them too. Roadblock events in particular love to use them."R\bShall I turn you back like a real roadblock, or should I deactivate myself?"k\bOkay. I'll fulfil my roadblock condition myself, by turning the Global Switch I depend on (5) to ON."p\bRoadblock events don't normally set the conditions they wait for (Global Switch 5 in my case), but I did."\bHaiiiii-yaaaaaah!"\bYou won, good job."You lost, too bad."B\bHello. This is what I say if you talk to me during the day."\bHalt! Who goes there?"5\bThis is what I say if you talk to me at night."Information"Shadow Pokémon battles"Purifying Pokémon"	Exit"Roadblock"DeactivateIu;␀$B[[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"m\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have finished your Journey to be a Pokemon Master."5\bBut do you really think you are the very best?"~\bWe have two Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."\bMuk! Muk!"Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."6\bWow! Well done on completing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"No[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING!  WARNING!]"Teleport?"m\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have finished your Journey to be a Pokemon Master."5\bBut do you really think you are the very best?"~\bWe have two Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."b\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome...  but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on 