 over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."\bMuk! Muk!"Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to b