Oak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"NoIu;␀}[["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"6\bOh! The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!",\bOh. The boulder is no