, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"h\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city?"�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar"%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun.">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this 