 to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"No[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"`\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response.  Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep Cit