okémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"Yes"NoIu;␀&[[*"1\bHe didn't know about the teleporters, huh?"<\bPlease don't tell him. He might faint from the truth."-\rHello there. You've been invited, huh?"K\rI heard the owner built this secret club for years. Impressive, huh?"B\rOf course, you decide if this is worth the effort. Tee hee."E\bHuff... puff... I have heard rumours. This untold sanctuary..."`\bThe secret hideout where the strongest trainers gather... puff... where legends are born."U\bI climbed so far and high... huff... Finally, I'm here... I need a breather..."<\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! We meet again! WAHAHAHA!"L\bDon't question how I got here so fast. Don't rack your brain over it.">\bAnyway, WELCOME TO THE GRANDEUR CLUB! WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"�\bI have been hearing lots of feedback from everyone, from finishing all of the post game events, waiting for Galar, yadda yadda."u\bPersonally, I was looking for a post-game challenge too. So I built this, with the help of my co-founder, Luc!"|\bBy the looks of it, you ain't no simpleton either! You're like me, somebody looking for a real challenge, am I right?"n\bI guess I am, I can practically smell the excitement on you. Well then, without further ado, take this."M\bLuc and I will be looking forward to your performance here. MUAHAHAHA!"T\bTaking a breather after a loss. It feels sad yet refreshing at the same time."_\bEvery time I go in, it's always a brand-new experience, waiting for me to break through!"\bGood luck!"�\bGood view, isn't it? The sunshine's embrace makes you warm. The cool breeze refreshes your senses. What a great place for good ol' lad to tell his legacy."�\bA minor mishap made me bedridden and out of action from work. The pandemic also kept me away from my loved one. I got bored till I found this world. 2 months of running around, gathering allies and defeating foes to the finish line."�\bI craved for more and this world deserved more, but the Driftveil Battle House wasn't a kicker for me. I NEEDED MORE. I seeked. I learned. Finally, I discovered this beautiful land. And with my friends, we're on a mission."�\bTop trainers across the multiverse gathered in the Grandeur Lounge to pit against each other. Challenges expanded and became more fleshed out."{\bBut no, I am still not satisfied. I need to break the limit. I need to give them what they want. I need the BIG BAD."�\bSo we experimented on all possible limits. We broke the constraints. And I had bigger, loftier dreams. Paldea! We fed our desires... till now."p\bEducation. Career. Marriage. Kids. Commitment arises. That's when I knew, our time was limited. Hahahaha."�\bThe world that Reinhart formed. The systems that Luc-ker expanded on. The peak that I envisioned. 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye."/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon...[*"1\bHe didn't know about the teleporters, huh?"<\bPlease don't tell him. He might faint from the truth."-\rHello there. You've been invited, huh?"L\rI heard the owner built this secret club for years.  Impressive, huh?"B\rOf course, you decide if this is worth the effort. Tee hee."E\bHuff... puff... I have heard rumours. This untold sanctuary..."`\bThe secret hideout where the strongest trainers gather... puff... where legends are born."U\bI climbed so far and high... huff... Finally, I'm here... I need a breather..."=\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! We meet again!  WAHAHAHA!"L\bDon't question how I got here so fast. Don't rack your brain over it."?\bAnyway, WELCOME TO THE GRANDEUR CLUB!  WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"�\bI have been hearing lots of feedback from everyone, from finishing all of the post game events, waiting for Galar, yadda yadda."u\bPersonally, I was looking for a post-game challenge too. So I built this, with the help of my co-founder, Luc!"|\bBy the looks of it, you ain't no simpleton either! You're like me, somebody looking for a real challenge, am I right?"n\bI guess I am, I can practically smell the excitement on you. Well then, without further ado, take this."M\bLuc and I will be looking forward to your performance here. MUAHAHAHA!"T\bTaking a breather after a loss. It feels sad yet refreshing at the same time."_\bEvery time I go in, it's always a brand-new experience, waiting for me to break through!"\bGood luck!"�\bGood view, isn't it? The sunshine's embrace makes you warm. The cool breeze refreshes your senses. What a great place for good ol' lad to tell his legacy."�\bA minor mishap made me bedridden and out of action from work. The pandemic also kept me away from my loved one. I got bored till I found this world. 2 months of running around, gathering allies and defeating foes to the finish line."�\bI craved for more and this world deserved more, but the Driftveil Battle House wasn't a kicker for me. I NEEDED MORE. I seeked. I learned. Finally, I discovered this beautiful land. And with my friends, we're on a mission."�\bTop trainers across the multiverse gathered in the Grandeur Lounge to pit against each other. Challenges expanded and became more fleshed out."{\bBut no, I am still not satisfied. I need to break the limit. I need to give them what they want. I need the BIG BAD."�\bSo we experimented on all possible limits. We broke the constraints. And I had bigger, loftier dreams. Paldea! We fed our desires... till now."q\bEducation. Career. Marriage. Kids. Commitment arises. That's when I knew, our time was limited.  Hahahaha."�\bThe world that Reinhart formed. The systems that Luc-ker expanded on. The peak that I envisioned. 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye."/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon...;[*"1\bHe didn't know about the teleporters, huh?"<\bPlease don't tell him. He might faint from the truth."-\rHello there. You've been invited, huh?"K\rI heard the owner built this secret club for years. Impressive, huh?"B\rOf course, you decide if this is worth the effort. Tee hee."E\bHuff... puff... I have heard rumours. This untold sanctuary..."`\bThe secret hideout where the strongest trainers gather... puff... where legends are born."U\bI climbed so far and high... huff... Finally, I'm here... I need a breather..."<\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! We meet again! WAHAHAHA!"L\bDon't question how I got here so fast. Don't rack your brain over it.">\bAnyway, WELCOME TO THE GRANDEUR CLUB! WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!"�\bI have been hearing lots of feedback from everyone, from finishing all of the post game events, waiting for Galar, yadda yadda."u\bPersonally, I was looking for a post-game challenge too. So I built this, with the help of my co-founder, Luc!"|\bBy the looks of it, you ain't no simpleton either! You're like me, somebody looking for a real challenge, am I right?"n\bI guess I am, I can practically smell the excitement on you. Well then, without further ado, take this."M\bLuc and I will be looking forward to your performance here. MUAHAHAHA!"T\bTaking a breather after a loss. It feels sad yet refreshing at the same time."_\bEvery time I go in, it's always a brand-new experience, waiting for me to break through!"\bGood luck!"�\bGood view, isn't it? The sunshine's embrace makes you warm. The cool breeze refreshes your senses. What a great place for good ol' lad to tell his legacy."�\bA minor mishap made me bedridden and out of action from work. The pandemic also kept me away from my loved one. I got bored till I found this world. 2 months of running around, gathering allies and defeating foes to the finish line."�\bI craved for more and this world deserved more, but the Driftveil Battle House wasn't a kicker for me. I NEEDED MORE. I seeked. I learned. Finally, I discovered this beautiful land. And with my friends, we're on a mission."�\bTop trainers across the multiverse gathered in the Grandeur Lounge to pit against each other. Challenges expanded and became more fleshed out."{\bBut no, I am still not satisfied. I need to break the limit. I need to give them what they want. I need the BIG BAD."�\bSo we experimented on all possible limits. We broke the constraints. And I had bigger, loftier dreams. Paldea! We fed our desires... till now."p\bEducation. Career. Marriage. Kids. Commitment arises. That's when I knew, our time was limited. Hahahaha."�\bThe world that Reinhart formed. The systems that Luc-ker expanded on. The peak that I envisioned. 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye."/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon...Iu;␀�[[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.;[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.Iu;␀\[["6\bI came to pray for my dearly departed Clefairy."F\rPokémon Tower was erected in the memory of Pokémon that died."\rI am a Channeler."H\rThere are spirits up to mischief. I sense that high in the Tower."A\bI can't stop worrying about everything that happened here." \bWant to learn Worry Seed?"\bDon't stress it."(\rMy Growlithe...\nWhy did you die?"$\rDid you come to pay respects?"(\rBless your Pokémon-loving heart.["6\bI came to pray for my dearly departed Clefairy."F\rPokémon Tower was erected in the memory of Pokémon that died."\rI am a Channeler."H\rThere are spirits up to mischief. I sense that high in the Tower."A\bI can't stop worrying about everything that happened here." \bWant to learn Worry Seed?"\bDon't stress it."(\rMy Growlithe...\nWhy did you die?"$\rDid you come to pay respects?"(\rBless your Pokémon-loving heart.;["6\bI came to pray for my dearly departed Clefairy."F\rPokémon Tower was erected in the memory of Pokémon that died."\rI am a Channeler."H\rThere are spirits up to mischief. I sense that high in the Tower."A\bI can't stop worrying about everything that happened here." \bWant to learn Worry Seed?"\bDon't stress it."(\rMy Growlithe...\nWhy did you die?"$\rDid you come to pay respects?"(\rBless your Pokémon-loving heart.Iu;␀_[[",\rBe careful.\nThe upstairs is haunted.[",\rBe careful.\nThe upstairs is haunted.;[",\rBe careful.\nThe upstairs is haunted.Iu;␀�[["\rLeave!"	Ugh!"6\rThe ghosts here are very mischievous. Be alert."5\rWhat are you doing here? Escape while you can!"I warned you.":\rThe others above...\nThey must have been possessed."\rGive me your soul!"NO!"\rSorry! I was possessed!["\rLeave!"	Ugh!"6\rThe ghosts here are very mischievous. Be alert."5\rWhat are you doing here? Escape while you can!"I warned you.":\rThe others above...\nThey must have been possessed."\rGive me your soul!"NO!"\rSorry! I was possessed!;["\rLeave!"	Ugh!"6\rThe ghosts here are very mischievous. Be alert."5\rWhat are you doing here? Escape while you can!"I warned you.":\rThe others above...\nThey must have been possessed."\rGive me your soul!"NO!"\rSorry! I was possessed!Iu;␀�[["\rWahh! Who are you?"What happened?"!\rI must have been dreaming."\rHelp me find the ghosts."Did you find one?"7\rWe can't determine the identity of the ghosts..."\rWho goes there?"Just a child."1\rMay the departed Pokémon rest in peace...["\rWahh! Who are you?"What happened?"!\rI must have been dreaming."\rHelp me find the ghosts."Did you find one?"7\rWe can't determine the identity of the ghosts..."\rWho goes there?"Just a child."1\rMay the departed Pokémon rest in peace...;["\rWahh! Who are you?"What happened?"!\rI must have been dreaming."\rHelp me find the ghosts."Did you find one?"7\rWe can't determine the identity of the ghosts..."\rWho goes there?"Just a child."1\rMay the departed Pokémon rest in peace...Iu;␀�[["\rPokémon...give!"
