 number!"L\rThe ID number of your PC-boxed \v[2] matches your Loto Ticket number!"/\rOh my goodness, all five digits matched!"$\rYou've won the jackpot prize!"E\rPlease do visit again! Good-bye from Felicity, your attendant!":\rYou have no room left. Make room, then come see me."@\rThe last four digits matched, so you win the first prize!"B\rThe last three digits matched, so you win the second prize!"?\rThe last two digits matched, so you win the third prize!";\rThe last digit matched, so you win the fourth prize!",\rOh, I see.\nPlease do visit us again."K\rYou've already drawn a Loto Ticket today. Please come back tomorrow.":\rI've been waiting for you. Here's the item you won."�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Grassy Seed - 100 coins,Misty Seed - 100 coins, Electric Seed - 100 coins,Psychic Seed - 100 coins, Master Ball - 9999 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Elgyem - 180 coins,Tynamo - 500 coins, Deino - 2800 coins,Zorua - 5500 coins, Larvesta - 9999 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Meowth - 180 coins,Milcery - 500 coins, Dreepy - 2800 coins,Falinks - 5500 coins, Kubfu - 9999 coins,No thanks]"N\bMr. Game: Show me how you play and make my heart pound with excitement!"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Blue Scarf - 800 coins,Red Scarf - 1000 coins, Pink Scarf - 1000 coins,Green Scarf - 1000 coins, Yellow Scarf - 1600 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Eject Button - 800 coins,Eviolite - 800 coins, Choice Band - 1600 coins,Choice Specs - 1600 coins, Choice Scarf - 1600 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Smoke Ball - 800 coins,Miracle Seed - 1000 coins, Charcoal - 1000 coins,Mystic Water - 1000 coins, Yellow Flute - 1600 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,6, Metronome - 1000 coins,Life Orb - 1000 coins, Leftovers - 1000 coins,Lucky Egg - 1600 coins, Ability Patch - 5000 coins,No thanks]"�\CN\bWhich prize would you like?\ch[1,