u?"a\bGoh: Good job driving them off. I need to leave for a Project Mew mission. Be sure to win."B\bI'm thinking about going fishing later. Can you believe it?",Would you like to take Sobble with you?"=\rI love watching Contests. Do you know any famous ones?"#\bYou didn't get this from me."\bYou never saw me."V\bWhat are you doing here? Didn't you know that the match was moved to Spikemuth?"G\bWe'll help you get there. Wouldn't want you to miss your battle."Train Station"\bMorgrem"8\rPeople from all over the world come to this city."(\bLeon: Excellent! To the next one."9\bThis is where the best Trainers in the world meet."^Wyndon\nThis booming metropolis was designed and developed by our very own Chairman Rose."\bCorviknight"\bWant to play?"*\bLeon: Let's take this one down too."1\bLeon: Let's move on. It's near Rose Tower."2\bHow would you like a life changing partner?"\bNo big deal."\bTake good care of it."g\rI entered the World Coronation Series last year. I struggled to even make it to the Great Class."0\bIt's fun to watch the Pokémon swim past."\bCharizard!"Rose of the Rondelands""\bWhere would you like to go?"G\bThe Wild Area holds dozens of Pokémon. You should check it out."]\bHold it. You're the Alola Champion! For the honor of my brother, I'll defeat you here."}\bGreat battle. The name is Hop. I'm Leon's younger brother. I just know he's going to be the winner by the end of this."=\bI won't hold you up any longer. Thanks for the battle."<\rI grew up here. The park has always been my favorite."Rose Tower"\\bLeon: Go meet with Chariman Rose. I'm going to keep dealing with the Dynamax problem."C\bI like to bike down this road. I'm taking a break right now."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Tony, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle.")Rotom Phone: Incoming call from Goh:";\bGoh: \PN, could you meet me back at the lab? Thanks."�\bGoh: \PN, I did it! I touched Mew with my own hands. With 