... and done! Enjoy!"@\bI'm taking a break before heading back out and exploring.">\rOleana: The upper limits of Rose Tower are off- limits."8\rOleana: Are you ready to meet with Chariman Rose?"5\rThe upper limits of Rose Tower are off-limits."}\bRose: Thank you for meeting with me, \PN. I can sense you have a lot of potential. It reminds me of when I discovered Leon."�\bWe've both worked hard to get where we are today. I plan to use that success to preserve the very best that Galar has to offer."�\bMy point is that you have promise as a Trainer and I'd like to offer my resources to support your battling ambitions. What do you think?"\b... You don't want it?"M\rOleana: How dare you. Do you have any idea what kind of honor this is?"H\bRose: Now, now, \PN is following his own path. I can admire that."\bThank you for your time."G\rA Champion, are you? I guess you might need something like this."a\rThose candies work based on experience over levels. Try using that one on a weak Pokémon."^\rMost people don't take the train these days. The Flying Taxi is how most people travel."\\bI've worked here for over a year. The stuff we're doing is going to change the world."8\bI like to come here after a long day of battling."Yes"No"Saffron"Goldenrod"	Exit"Freezington[6"]\rI came all the way from Alola for this vacation. I can't wait to get back home though."6\rOh, are you new? Please enjoy one on the house."%\rPlease continue to support us."\rOr..."9\bI always believed in the classics. Here, take one."L\bThose were our only options when I was a Trainer.  That or hard work."\rOleana: Are you leaving?"6\rI'm waiting till it's dark to explore the city."[\bGalar is home to Dynamax. Rumor has it that the power came from an ancient Pokémon."^\rLiving here isn't easy. There's so much going on it can be hard to keep up with it all."#\bI want to go battle someone."\bWelcome to Rose Tower."*\bThis hotel is the height of luxury."n\bI've referred multiple matches for the Champio