r."/\bWhatever. You're here now. Get in there.")\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me."~\bNow, Wyndon Stadium is crammed full with spectators. You can already hear cheers in anticipation of the heated battles."G\bThis is the Pokémon World Coronation Series Masters Tournament."�\bThe biggest tournament in history, where the highest ranked eight, the Masters Eight, determine the greatest Pokémon battler."G\bAnd so, which of them will be crowned the Championships Monarch?".\bNow, let's introduce the Masters Eight."H\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Steven."I\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Cynthia."E\bWe are busy setting up for the finals. Please come back later."O\bIn the meantime, could you help us deal with some commotion in the city?"F\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me for your battle against Leon."(\rHello. Welcome to Wyndon Stadium."n\rHello, \PN of the Masters 8. Would you like ask the current Monarch to hold a Masters 8 tournament now?"M\rHello, Monarch \PN. Would you like to hold a Masters 8 tournament now?"5\rOk, please give me a moment to contact them..." \rAlright, let's set it up."\rEnjoy and good luck!"#\rNo problem. Have a good day."g\rDynamax is something that can be done at this stadium. It's not something you can do everywhere."%\bI want to battle Leon one day."I\bLance just became Champion. He's on a roll and he'll win here too."N\bSteven: So it will be a battle between us. I wish you the best of luck."%\bGoh: Leon seems really strong."I\bGoh: That was a great battle, \PN. Should we head back to the lab?"6\bLeon is the clear winner. Plus, he's very cool."\rSteelix"
\bNin"O\rThe battle against Lance was intense. I couldn't take my eyes off of it."<\bDiantha has to win. She deserves it for her strategy."Z\rCynthia: I believe you'll do quite well here. I'm also happy to see Iris qualified."@\rCynthia: Are you prepared for our battle? I certainly am.")\rCynthia: I'll be cheering for you."$\rI come here for every battle."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"Q\rSteven is the obvious choice. His skill in battle is better than everyone."g\bAlain: I'm not surprised to see you made it as well. Let's meet up in the finals like last time."\bLeon is amazing!"S\bRaihan: Man, Leon sure is tough. No matter what I try I just can't best him."w\bOh, you're in the World Coronation Series too? You still have a long way to go before reaching the Master Class."p\bWho knows, maybe you'll even battle me. But don't think I'll let you get in the way of me defeating Leon."x\bRaihan: Who knows, maybe you'll even battle me. But don't think I'll let you get in the way of me defeating Leon.".\r\PN will win. I can feel it in my soul."U\bLeon: The Masters Eight. Let's make this one even more exciting than the last!"?\bLeon: The next battle will be even better than the last."'\bLeon: I'm pumped for our battle."Yes"No[\"\bIndeedee"(\bDo you think I can enter one day?"X\rIris: Do you think I could ask Cynthia and Diantha for a picture? I'm so nervous."'\rLeon's Charizard is uns