\bNin"O\rThe battle against Lance was intense. I couldn't take my eyes off of it."<\bDiantha has to win. She deserves it for her strategy."Z\rCynthia: I believe you'll do quite well here. I'm also happy to see Iris qualified."@\rCynthia: Are you prepared for our battle? I certainly am.")\rCynthia: I'll be cheering for you."$\rI come here for every battle."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"Q\rSteven is the obvious choice. His skill in battle is better than everyone."g\bAlain: I'm not surprised to see you made it as well. Let's meet up in the finals like last time."\bLeon is amazing!"S\bRaihan: Man, Leon sure is tough. No matter what I try I just can't best him."w\bOh, you're in the World Coronation Series too? You still have a long way to go before reaching the Master Class."p\bWho knows, maybe you'll even battle me. But don't think I'll let you get in the way of me defeating Leon."x\bRaihan: Who knows, maybe you'll even battle me. But don't think I'll let you get in the way of me defeating Leon.".\r\PN will win. I can feel it in my soul."U\bLeon: The Masters Eight. Let's make this one even more exciting than the last!"?\bLeon: The next battle will be even better than the last."'\bLeon: I'm pumped for our battle."Yes"NoIu;␀f	[[ "0\bI've always wanted to train next to Koga." How will I impress him now?"?\bEven though I lost, I will continue to train under Koga."\rReady to los