ering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."l\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle.  But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"L\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules.  You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"^\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh?  Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"X\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello!  I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"g\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation...  We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"\\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think.  I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"~\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia.  Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."|\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do.  Dream big."|\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant.  I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"f\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden?  I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."O\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view.  Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."}\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you.  You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."{\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're...  titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."_\rI believe you have the potential to do great things.  But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"v\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover.  There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."{\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk.  Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored?  Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"d\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions!  I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"T\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning.  I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"T\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing!  I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"]\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you.  It makes me sleepy to be here alone."W\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well...  I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"P\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you...  You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"K\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon?  Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."U\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate!  Feel the burning curiosity!"z\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac!  I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."^\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day!  The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"g\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected!  I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"g\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill!  I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"s\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh...  demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"d\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say.  It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Z\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here!  No holds barred. No hard feelings!"~\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right.  Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."[\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you.  Don't bring shame to us by losing!"l\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills.  But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"q\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have...  and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon?  Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."c\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you!  That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine!"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."I\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed.  Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with.  There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."y\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I’m an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they’re fans of mine!"�\rOften, they’ll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."W\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do!  Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"^\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That’s true of people and Pokémon alike!"t\rI’ve definitely noticed what your good points are! I’ll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."i\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon!  Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"y\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic!  Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter.  I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"V\rMina: Hrmmm! Well, this is frustrating. I failed to really use my full power..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"h\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can’t let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."X\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it?  Come on, let's try to cheer up!"p\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot?  I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."^\bDon't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."a\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer.  I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."w\bIt’s been a while since I’ve walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It’s a nice feeling."P\bNow I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."v\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together!  There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."i\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can’t be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"e\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose.  They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."^\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"[\rLet’s be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"i\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."6\bI’d be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"v\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun...  Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."R\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate!  Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an expert authority of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."h\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too.  I'm grateful that you made me realize that."N\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute!  Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"g\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different.  But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."f\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members.  To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"W\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine.  Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."@\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well.  Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."l\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you.  The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."o\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon.  Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"P\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon.  Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."T\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon.  Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"}\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon.  They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear.  Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"`\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style.  You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"w\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'!  Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."k\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?!  You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"n\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away!  Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."I\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again?  So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don’t expect to be forgiven. I’m simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"c\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too.  I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people.  Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"U\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong.  Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here?  On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."o\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me!  Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"X\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger.  That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"U\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what?  More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."P\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already?  Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."q\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD!  Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever!  Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen.  Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it?  Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"_\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out...  But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat.  I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."n\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy.  ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."I\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here?  On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"z\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon.  Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!"?\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us?  *laughs*"X\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND!  And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."h\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me?  Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."[\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress.  And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."~\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters.  So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon?  Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."V\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon.  Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it?  Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"x\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say.  You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right.  Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"X\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you.  Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"_\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do!  Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"P\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece!  Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."d\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"Y\bMolayne: Now I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"=\bElio: I’d be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"}\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon.  Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"	Left"	Down"
Right"Yes"No"Stay and Confront"Return to Lobby"Escape;[�"Choose your path."U\bMilo: Well then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"h\rNessa: No matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."i\bKabu: In the end, the match will be decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."G\rBea: I think I'll test that unshakable spirit of yours, shall I?"#\bAllister: H...here...I go..."Y\rOpal: I'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."4\bGordie: Size means strength! Savor this pain!"p\rMelony: All righty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."Q\bAvery: Prepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"-\rKlara: You'll never know what hit you!"O\bPiers: Get ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"M\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"P\bRaihan: Bring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"^\bMustard: Don't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"n\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolutely champion time!"<\bHop: So let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"a\bBede: I suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how pathetic you are and how strong I am."U\rMarnie: It'd be no fun if things ended quick... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"M\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna give it a taste test?"B\rGloria: Ok, wait no further! All pumped up and ready to go!"\\rMagnolia: So, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."(\rSonia: Let's give it our all now!"a\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, then Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"�\bRose: I saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."k\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle. But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"K\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules. You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"]\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh? Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"W\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello! I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"f\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"[\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think. I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"}\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia. Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."{\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do. Dream big."{\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant. I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"e\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden? I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."N\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view. Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."|\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you. You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."z\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're... titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."^\rI believe you have the potential to do great things. But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"u\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover. There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."z\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk. Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored? Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"c\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions! I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"S\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning. I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"S\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing! I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine!"�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."y\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I’m an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they’re fans of mine!"�\rOften, they’ll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"^\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That’s true of people and Pokémon alike!"t\rI’ve definitely noticed what your good points are! I’ll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"V\rMina: Hrmmm! Well, this is frustrating. I failed to really use my full power..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"h\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can’t let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."^\bDon't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."w\bIt’s been a while since I’ve walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It’s a nice feeling."P\bNow I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."i\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can’t be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."^\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"[\rLet’s be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"i\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."6\bI’d be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an expert authority of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughened ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don’t expect to be forgiven. I’m simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."p\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!">\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us? *laughs*"W\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND! And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."Z\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress. And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."}\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters. So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"^\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"O\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."d\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"Y\bMolayne: Now I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"=\bElio: I’d be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"|\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"	Left"	Down"
