 take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rAudino"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[%"E\bThe food is great! Sometimes we get to watch a gym battle too."G\bCress: Try Chili first. His passion will burn right through you."L\bCress: My turn now. Don't be sorry that you jumped into the deep end."L\bCress: The final challenge is Cilan. He may snare you in his tactics."W\bCress: You are a ripple in the pond. May you continue to touch those around you."*\rWelcome to the Striaton Restaurant!"j\bCilan uses Grass type Pokémon. They are weak against the Bug, Fire, Poison, Flying, and Ice types."{\bThey are strong against Water, Ground, and Rock. Electirc, Grass, Ground, and Water moves also don't do much damage."C\bCilan: Welcome to the Striaton Gym. Your aroma is marvelous."W\bCilan: It seems my turn has finally come. It's time for the battle to be served."<\bCilan: Well brothers, it seems \PN has beaten us all."$\bYou've earned the Trio Badge."%\bCress: Here, have this TM too."9\bTM109 contains Dive. A two-turn water type attack."%\bChili: Here's one from me too!"V\bTM38 contains Fire Blast. A powerful force of fire that may burn your opponent."5\bCilan: Last but not least, here's one from me."@\bTM108 contains Solar Blade. A two-turn grass type attack."|\bCilan: Your way of battle has inspired me. I'm going to travel the land and savor as many of the savory delights as I can."0\bChili: You seem like a strong challenger.">\bCress: Why not battle us all? I'm sure you'll enjoy it."{\bCilan: An excellent idea! How about you start with Chili for the appe