[[ "m\bCheren: Hello there. I'm sorry, but the gym is still under construction. Come back when it's finished."z\bOh, \PN. Professor Juniper told me about you. I'm sure you will be an interesting challenge. Don't prove her wrong."O\bCheren: Unfortunately I can't give you a badge, but I can give you this."r\bTM79 contains Thrash. The attacks lasts for two or three turns, with the user becoming confused afterwards."W\bCheren: Feel free to enter the White Ruins. You seem strong enough to handle it."Choose a status option."-A Pokémon can't attack if it is asleep."2Pokémon will stay asleep even after battles."+Use Awkening to awaken one from sleep."AA burn reduces attack power. It also causes ongoing HP loss.">A burn remains after battle. Use Bun Heal to cure a burn."7When poisoned, a Pokémon's health steadily drops."BPoison lingers after battles. Use an Antidote to cure poison!"FParalysis reduces speed and may prevent the Pokémon from moving."DParalysis remains after battles. Use Parlyz Heal for treatment."0It stays frozen even after the battle ends."3A frozen Pokémon becomes helplessly immobile."5Use Ice Heal to thaw out the suffering Pokémon."3When confused, a Pokémon's may attack itself."0Confusion does not last if recalled though."
