 Pokémon. Just wait and see."W\rLana: Hi \PN. You just missed my new friend, Dewpider. I didn't catch it though."ARotom Dex: Mallow will be in her dad's shop in Hau'oli City."9\rLana: Let's battle again soon. I know you like it."P\bSophocles: Don't bother me right now. I'm working on something important."9\rYou're the new student? The school isn't this way."�\bKukui: You didn't have to step in there; I could have handled him. Keep your eyes open. I doubt that's the last we'll see of Guzma."(\bFor now, why don't you head home?"\rPopplio"\rPikipek"\rTrumbeak"\rToucannon">Zeraora seems to want to come with you. Will you take it?"\bMr. Mime"\rTogedemaru"\bTurtonator" Rotom Dex: Let's head home."nRotom Dex: ...I just received a message from the professor. He said to head to the school for a surprise."KRotom Dex: ...Wait, did you hear that in the school? Head back inside."aRotom Dex: I just received word of another Ultra Beast being spotted. Let's head to Route 3."I\bI love living so close to the beach. Nice to come home and unwind."g\bTupp: Yo, what's this? You think you're better than us? I say instead you give us your Pokémon."\rYo yo."\rThat isn't fair.".\bKiawe: Let's try that again Turtonator."G\bKiawe: Lillie wanted to talk with you. I'll be ready afterwards."r\bKiawe: I'm going to take you to my home on Akala Island. I know you've wanted to explore the other islands."1\bTalk to Charizard when you're ready to go."U\rI wish they would get rid of that grass already. Makes it so hard to get home."Akala Island"	Exit"Paniola Ranch"Paniola"Wela Volcano"Ten Carat"Yes"No"Hau'oli City"Manalo Stadium[Y")\bIt's a shame the bridge is broken."(\bLooks like they fixed the bridge."!\rCan't stop me now, can ya?"#\rThis won't happen again, yo."W\bThis is the best place to hang out. The rest of the island is too busy to relax."0\rRapp: Yo, what do you think you're doing?"$\rAlola! Welcome to our school."\bCharizard"Litten ignored you."o\bTupp: Yo, I'm going to m