one acts like I don't exist. It's not fair!"+\rLusamine: Good to see you again \PN."\bTurtonator"^\rMisty: Surprise! Bet you weren't expecting to see me here. You can thank Lana for that."S\rThis may be a vacation for me, but don't think I can't beat you in a battle."�\rMisty: Ugh, I still can't win. Maybe Brock will have a better chance. Last I heard he said he was going to visit Nurse Joy at the Pokémon Center."0\bSamson: Take your seat and we will begin."\rSweet!"\rSteenee"\rTsareena"a\bSophocles: The Mossdeep Space Center was incredible. I'm glad Molayne was able to take me."8\bBut you probably want a battle. I suppose we can."=\bSophocles: I'm going to stay here. I'll see you later."C\bKukui: Take your seat, cousin, and we will start the lesson."9\bKukui: Come look at the board if you're ever lost."4\bKukui: Sit down and we will continue, cousin."$\bKukui: I'll meet you at home."1\bKukui: Sit down and we will start, cousin."4\bKukui: It should be found in Melemele Meadow."6\bKukui: Wasn't it nice of Lana to organize this?" \bKukui: Head for the boat."3\bKukui: I wish you luck. Come visit sometime."6\bKukui: Alola, cousin! How'd our champion doing?"4\bWhy don't you take a seat for old times sake?"I\bKukui: I'm not here to battle you. I already know you can beat me."K\bKukui: It was great to see you again, \PN. We'll be rooting for you.""\bKukui: Take a seat, cousin."K\bKukui: If was great to see you again, \PN. We'll be rooting for you."3\rLana: My name is Lana. Nice to meet you \PN."+\rLana: I guess you want to battle me."/\rLana: I can't wait to go home and relax."(\rLana: I wonder what's in the egg."*\rLana: Akala Island sounds exciting."-\rLana: I've never been to Kanto before."\rLana: Another trip?"'\rLana: It's going to be too cold."%\rLana: Popplio and I have this.";\rLana: All the adults in town have lost their energy."6\rLana: I invited Misty and Brock to visit Alola."5\rLana: I plan on meeting up with an old friend.""\rLana: This trip sounds fun.