 at the blimp."�\bKukui: For today we are going to visit the Aether Paradise. It's full of many wild Pokémon and Miss Lusamine is in charge of the place."g\rLusamine: I'm always willing to do something nice for my little girl. This trip will be a blast."3\bLet's head over to the ship in Hau'oli City."\\bKukui: Today we are heading to Mount Lanakila.  The snowy mountain on Ula'ula Island!"S\bKukui: Lusamine and I had a chat and she has a special offer for all of you."w\rLusamine: Due to your brave actions in rescuing me, I want to give you all the chance to become Ultra Guardians."�\rBy doing this you will hunt down Ultra Beasts that pop up around Alola and help them find their way back home. I know you can all do it."l\bKukui: With that said, the first one has already been spotted. It should be found in Melemele Meadow."f\bBeast Balls might help getting them easier.  Lusamine sent someone over who will sell you some."L\rMallow: Everyone else noticed that the adults are super tired, right?"E\rLana: I was hoping it was just my parents that were like that."0\bKiawe: We need to do something to fix it."!\bSophocles: Sure, but what?"�\rLillie: My mother called earlier today and told me what needs done. We need to go on an Ultra Guardians mission to the Altar of the Sunne."+Rotom Dex: Let's all head to the boat!"�\bKukui: It's finally time that we head to Poni Island. All of you have your individual research projects, and I'll be leaving it up to you to complete them."x\bLana, you're to meet up with your friend. Kiawe, you're to train. Mallow, you're to learn how to make a new dish."�\bSophocles, you're to evolve your Charjabug. Lillie, you're to study the Pokémon living on the island. And finally \PN, you're to have your final Grand Trial."I\bNow that everyone is ready, head over to the boat.  And good luck."{\bKukui: Alola everyone. Today we're heading to Malie City, a city that takes heavy inspiration from the Johto region."o\bFeel free to explore the unique culture. \PN, there is even a gym for you to participate in if you wish."N\bEveryone, let's take the boat to Tapu Village and head east from there."o\bKukui: Alola everyone. I'm very excited to announce that the first ever Alola League has been completed."�\bI know all of you have been looking forward to it, so let's not waste any time. Head for the boat in Hau'oli City and let's head over."i\bKukui: Alola everyone. As you're all aware, your vacation is starting and school will be on break."%\bWhat does everyone plan to do?"9\bSophocles: I'm going to the Mossdeep Space Center.":\rLana: My dad and I are going to look for a Manaphy."M\rMallow: I'm going to make my father's kitchen the best it can ever be."G\rLillie: My family and I are going to look for my missing father."S\bKiawe: I'm continuing my island challenge. One day I'll be an Island Kahuna."g\bKukui: What about you, \PN? Going to travel the world some more? Sounds like a great plan to me."a\bKiawe: Not so fast. We never got to battle in the Manalo Conference. \PN, do me the honor."(\bKukui: That's it everyone. Enjoy-"�Rotom Dex: Wait. I also want to talk about what I'm doing. If \PN is returning home, then I'm going to work with the Aether Foundation."C\PN, it's been wonderful being your Pokédex. Until next time."Q\bKukui: On that note, it's time you all went your own ways. Alola everyone."l\bKukui: Everyone, let's give \PN and Goh a strong Alolan welcome! It's great to see our champion back."�\bOf course, becoming a champion wasn't enough for him and he's now in the World Coronation Series.  No doubt he'll be the one to win it."b\bKiawe: Professor! I want to battle \PN. I want to help him get even stronger so he can win."V\bKukui: How about it, \PN? Or would you rather battle someone else? Your choice."_\bKukui: Everyone, let's give a strong Alola welcome to Lillie and Gladion's father, Mohn!"\bMohn: Thank you, everyone, for the hospitality. I know I've missed so much, but I promise I'm not going anywhere from now on."(\rLillie: Professor. Where's Kiawe?"�\bKukui: He left to do some last minute training upon learning \PN was coming back. There's a Battle Royal taking place soon. \PN, I assume you're interested."M\bMohn: I haven't seen one of those in years. Let's head over and watch."\rPopplio"\rBrionne"\rPrimarina"Meltan"It's a Meltan."(Would you like to take it with you?"\bCharja"\bVika"%\rLillie: Nice to meet you, \PN."L\rLillie: I'm not actually a Trainer. You'll have to pick someone else.".\rLillie: I'll take good care of the egg."2\rLillie: This trip will be very educational."$\rLillie: This sounds exciting."*\rLillie: This is going to be hard..."5\rLillie: Snowy's egg was found on the mountain!"8\rLillie: Being an Ultra Guardian will be exciting!"a\rLillie: My mom just called the school. She said we need to head to the Altar of the Sunne."$Rotom Dex: Let's take the boat."S\rLillie: I wonder what they think of Alola? I hope they don't find it boring.",\rLillie: I don't know about this trip."1\rLillie: I'm curious what a gym looks like."L\rLillie: Snowy and I are looking forward to this. Don't go easy on us."7\rLillie: I still can't believe you're a Champion."6\rLillie: Perhaps I'll see you during my travels."-\bGoh: H-Hey \PN. Your friends are nice."c\rLillie: I'm so happy we found my father. Nihilego is a great addition to the family as well."B\rLillie: Hello there. Please keep that Pikachu away from me."4\rLusamine: I've dreamed of this day for years."7It looks lost. Would you like to take it with you?";Rotom Dex: Another Ultra Beast found! Let's head home."Q\bSophocles: You're the new classmate? I can't wait to learn more about you."\bSophocles: Me? Okay..."!\bSophocles: I need a break."'\bSophocles: Today was pretty fun.";\bSophocles: I hope it doesn't take long to get there."3\bSophocles: This trip sounds like a good one."4\bSophocles: This sounds like my kind of place."(\bSophocles: I'm going to freeze...")\bSophocles: I guess I can help out."B\bSo