now."C\bSamson: She said yes then? Excellent! Welcome to the school."5\bSamson: Hello \PN. How's school going for you?"G\bSamson: My egg hatched into a Kantoian Vulpix.  What a surprise."\bSamson: zzz..."T\bSamson: I feel so much more alert. Ready to run this school with a new vigor."I\bSamson: The Pokémon League has begun. Perhaps I'll see you there."5\bSamson: The league sure was full of surprises."V\bSamson: Enjoy your holiday, \PN. I hope you'll come back one day to see us all."\rTogedemaru"%Your Pokémon were fully healed."\rVulpix"C\bMohn: Being here really brings me back. So much has changed."P\rMallow: I hear you're from Kanto! I bet you have a bunch of cool stories."=\rMallow: So it's me then. Don't be sorry when you lose."K\rMallow: Maybe you can come over some time and experience my cooking."T\rMallow: Looking at the eggs just makes me want to go home and cook some food.":\rMallow: I wonder if there is good food to be found?".\rMallow: I hope to see some Grass types!"/\rMallow: I wonder what we will see there."5\rMallow: Poor Steenee isn't going to like this."6\rMallow: I'm prepared to hunt some Ultra Beasts."3\rMallow: We have to do something to fix this."S\rMallow: Lana's sneaky. She organized the whole thing without anyone knowing."-\rMallow: Maybe I should cook something."k\rMallow: I think I'll leave Tsareena here. It should be fine if I travel without any Pokémon, right?"2\rMallow: A league, huh? I guess I'll try it."\rMallow: Morning.":\rMallow: Come see the restaurant when you have time."H\rMallow: Alola, \PN. I worked hours on making a good meal for you."5\rMallow: Don't think I'll lose without a fight.")\rMallow: We'll see you soon, right?"E\rMallow: I'm so happy Lillie and her family are together again."\bMarowak"Yes"No;[,"\bI go to this school too."7\bEveryone acts like I don't exist. It's not fair!"+\rLusamine: Good to see you again \PN."\bTurtonator"^\rMisty: Surprise! Bet you weren't expecting to see me here. You can thank Lana 