ent found for the World Coronation Series. Carmo, located in Pewter City, is ready for battle."n\bKukui: Looks like you have another battle lined up. Good luck, \PN. We'll be rooting for you from home.""\rLana: Come back again soon.",\rLana: It's great to see Lillie again."\bVulpix!"H\bKiawe: I'm Kiawe. It's nice to meet a fellow battler like myself."<\bKiawe: I knew you would pick the strongest out of us."#\bKiawe: What a day. I'm beat."*\bKiawe: I wish I could have the egg."H\bKiawe: There should be all kinds of new Pokémon for you to find."5\bKiawe: I can't imagine what we will see there."?\bKiawe: Visiting a science place isn't the most exciting."D\bKiawe: I won't get cold. I'm made of firey passion after all."8\bKiawe: My team and I will be able to handle this."N\bKiawe: My farm is in shambles. My parents are too tired to do anything!"*\bKiawe: It's good to see them again.",\bKiawe: I'm going to battle Tapu Fini.".\bKiawe: I can't wait to try out the gym."C\bKiawe: Just you wait, \PN. I'm going to become the Champion."8\bKiawe: I'm fired up. This class will be exciting."&\bKiawe: That was a great battle."X\bKiawe: I'm concerned about Goh. He doesn't like to battle. Who do you battle now?"0\bKiawe: I'll get you into shape. Let's go!",\bKiawe: Good luck in your next battle."\bEevee"2\bGladion: I'm ready to get back to training."MRotom Dex:... It's hiding in the plants on the right side of the school."r\bKukui: Alola! For our first lesson with our new student we are going to explore the forest near the school."\bAlola has a bunch of new Pokémon for \PN to see. Come find me in the forest and we will head back whenever you're done."S\bKukui: Let's have a battle now that everyone is here. Pick whoever you want."g\bKukui: That was a great battle. Before we go, I see \PN has a Z-Ring on. Where did you get that?"Y\bWhat!? Tapu Koko! It's rare for the guardian deity to take an interest in someone."}\bAnyways, that Z-Ring will allow you to use Z- Moves. With a Z-Crystal, you can unleash powerful attacks during battle."_\bClearing a trial is a good way to earn one. That's it for today. Everyone can head home."o\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have two eggs in front of us. Who wants to raise one?"g\rLillie: I do! I would love to get over my fear of Pokémon and maybe starting small will fix it."}\bSamson: Well if there are no objections then the egg is yours. I'll take the other one. I'm excited to see what it becomes."i\bKukui: Glad we got that figured out. I also wanted to quickly explain to \PN what Alola forms are."|\bIn Alola, some Pokémon look and behave different than they do elsewhere in the world. You may have seen some by now."o\bIn fact, even Pikachu evolves into something different: an Electric and Psychic type. Isn't it amazing!?"h\bWell that's it for now. \PN, head over to Lillie's place and make sure the egg gets there safely."~\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have a special trip planned today. But first, let me introduce our guest."*\bThis is Olivia. Say Alola everyone."D\rOlivia: Nice to meet you all. I'm the Kahuna of Akala Island."v\bKukui: Speaking of Akala, we are all going to be going there as a field trip. I want you to explore the island."k\b\PN, I've already told everyone else what they could do. There's a trial there for you to look into."8\bWell that's it for now. Let's go to Akala Island!"BRotom Dex: There is a boat in Hau'oli City that will take us."�\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. Today we are going to learn about Mega Evolution and see some Kantonian forms."s\bAnd what better place to do that than Kanto? I hope everyone is ready because we are heading to Pallet Town!"s\bProbably not the most exciting for you \PN, but everyone else has never been there. Let's meet at the blimp."�\bKukui: For today we are going to visit the Aether Paradise. It's full of many wild Pokémon and Miss Lusamine is in charge of the place."g\rLusamine: I'm always willing to do something nice for my little girl. This trip will be a blast."3\bLet's head over to the ship in Hau'oli City."[\bKukui: Today we are heading to Mount Lanakila. The snowy mountain on Ula'ula Island!"S\bKukui: Lusamine and I had a chat and she has a special offer for all of you."w\rLusamine: Due to your brave actions in rescuing me, I want to give you all the chance to become Ultra Guardians."�\rBy doing this you will hunt down Ultra Beasts that pop up around Alola and help them find their way back home. I know you can all do it."l\bKukui: With that said, the first one has already been spotted. It should be found in Melemele Meadow."e\bBeast Balls might help getting them easier. Lusamine sent someone over who will sell you some."L\rMallow: Everyone else noticed that the adults are super tired, right?"E\rLana: I was hoping it was just my parents that were like that."0\bKiawe: We need to do something to fix it."!\bSophocles: Sure, but what?"�\rLillie: My mother called earlier today and told me what needs done. We need to go on an Ultra Guardians mission to the Altar of the Sunne."+Rotom Dex: Let's all head to the boat!"�\bKukui: It's finally time that we head to Poni Island. All of you have your individual research projects, and I'll be leaving it up to you to complete them."x\bLana, you're to meet up with your friend. Kiawe, you're to train. Mallow, you're to learn how to make a new dish."�\bSophocles, you're to evolve your Charjabug. Lillie, you're to study the Pokémon living on the island. And finally \PN, you're to have your final Grand Trial."H\bNow that everyone is ready, head over to the boat. And good luck."{\bKukui: Alola everyone. Today we're heading to Malie City, a city that takes heavy inspiration from the Johto region."o\bFeel free to explore the unique culture. \PN, there is even a gym for you to participate in if you wish."N\bEveryone, let's take the boat to Tapu Village and head east from there."o\bKukui: Alola everyone. I'm very excited to announce that the first ever Alola League has been completed."�\bI know all of you have been looking forward to it, so let's not waste any time. Head for the boat in Hau'oli City and let's head over."i\bKukui: Alola everyone. As you're all aware, your vacation is starting and school will be on break."%\bWhat does everyone plan to do?"9\bSophocles: I'm going to the Mossdeep Space Center.":\rLana: My dad and I are going to look for a Manaphy."M\rMallow: I'm going to make my father's kitchen the best it can ever be."G\rLillie: My family and I are going to look for my missing father."S\bKiawe: I'm continuing my island challenge. One day I'll be an Island Kahuna."g\bKukui: What about you, \PN? Going to travel the world some more? Sounds like a great plan to me."a\bKiawe: Not so fast. We never got to battle in the Manalo Conference. \PN, do me the honor."(\bKukui: That's it everyone. Enjoy-"�Rotom Dex: Wait. I also want to talk about what I'm doing. If \PN is returning home, then I'm going to work with the Aether Foundation."C\PN, it's been wonderful being your Pokédex. Until next time."Q\bKukui: On that note, it's time you all went your own ways. Alola everyone."l\bKukui: Everyone, let's give \PN and Goh a strong Alolan welcome! It's great to see our champion back."�\bOf course, becoming a champion wasn't enough for him and he's now in the World Coronation Series. No doubt he'll be the one to win it."b\bKiawe: Professor! I want to battle \PN. I want to help him get even stronger so he can win."V\bKukui: How about it, \PN? Or would you rather battle someone else? Your choice."_\bKukui: Everyone, let's give a strong Alola welcome to Lillie and Gladion's father, Mohn!"\bMohn: Thank you, everyone, for the hospitality. I know I've missed so much, but I promise I'm not going anywhere from now on."(\rLillie: Professor. Where's Kiawe?"�\bKukui: He left to do some last minute training upon learning \PN was coming back. There's a Battle Royal taking place soon. \PN, I assu