 How are you doing \PN? It's good to see you again."{\rBurnet: How are you doing \PN? Kukui and the Pokémon here are doing well. Our son, Lei, should be happy to see you."_Rotom Dex: I just got information about another Ultra Beast sighting. Let's go to Route 3."]Where would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Kanto,Orange, Johto,Hoenn,Sinnoh,Unova,Kalos,Cancel]"cWhere would you like to go?\ch[1,-1,Kanto,Orange, Johto,Hoenn,Sinnoh,Unova,Kalos,Galar,Cancel]"%Your Pokémon were fully healed."M\bKukui: Good morning \PN. For today I've got a fun lesson plan for you."Cosmog!"\bKukui: What the?!"IRotom Dex: It looks like Nebby teleported us! I wonder where we are?"ARotom: Good morning. Let's go for a walk in the woods today."\rMunch..."0\bKukui: There's an Ultra Beast on Route 3."%\bKukui: Did you have fun today?"\\bKukui: Head over to the ship in Hau'oli. I'll inform the class on where you're going."A\bKukui: That's already your third win. Just one more to go!"g\bKukui: Good job. Now that that's taken care of, I want to take everyone to Hokulani Observatory."k\bLet's head to the ship and go to Mount Lanakila. Everyone else got a head start while you were busy."�\bKukui: You're back. The Masked Royal wants to have a battle with you. He told me to tell you to meet him at the Royal Avenue Battle Dome.":\bHow do I know the Masked Royal? Um, we go way back."P\bKukui: I heard you did good in your battle. Wish I could have been there."\bKukui: So you found it?"F\bKukui: Boy, do I feel a lot better. What a long day, eh cousin?"C\bKukui: Your last trial is over at last. You must feel proud."�\bKukui: Great news \PN! We finally fixed the bridge next to the school. That means you can challenge the island trials on this island."�\bThey are kind of similar to gym battles, but distinct. Speak to Hala in the next town over. He will fill you in on the details."O\bSpeak to Hala in the next town over. He will fill you in on the details."Yes"NoIu;␀[["\rAlola!"9\rI love it here. It's so