our mother and I are here to watch you win."L\bNanu: I got dragged into this. Still, maybe it will be worth a watch."@\bSophocles: There's so much to consider. What should I do?"7\bSophocles: This is when it gets really exciting."*\bSophocles: I have a foolproof plan."G\bSophocles: Kiawe is good. It was a close call and he barely won."0\bSophocles: You're so close. Keep pushing."9\rAcerola: Ah, you're here too. Should have guessed."2\rAcerola: I'm battling Kiawe. Sounds spooky."J\rAcerola: I may be out, but that just means I can cheer everyone on."+\rAcerola: I'm pumped for your battle."8\rOlivia: I'm a referee. I hope to see you advance."1\rLana: I bet the first round will be tough.""\rLana: The Top 16. I did it!"2\rLana: Guzma looks scary. I hope I beat him."6\rLana: Guzma beat me easily. Get revenge for me."?\rLana: A battle between you and Gladion. Sounds exciting.">\rHello. Here you can register for the Manalo Conference.""\rWould you like to register?",\rGreat! Let's set you up for a battle."<\rYour first battle will be to the far left. Good luck!"#\rNo problem. Have a good day."#\rYou have already registered."�\rOh my, is that Alola's Champion and World Monarch \PN? Are you sure you want to register for the Manalo Conference? It might be too easy for you..."�\rOk then... well, we've changed the format a little bit, being that the Battle Royale ends when there's 32 contestants left, instead of 16."�\rFor you specifically, you also have to battle 4 trainers, including one of your classmates, in order to move on. Don't ask me why, I have no idea either."6\rGood luck! Though you probably won't need it..."\rComfey"Y\bSamson: Surprised to see me? Your principal isn't going to sit back and miss this.".\bSamson: Haha, if only Sam could see me."$\bSamson: Top 16 isn't too bad."k\bKukui: Excited? I am! The first round is a Battle Royale. Be one of the last 16 standing to move on."M\bIf you end up the Champion you'll even get to battle the Masked Royal."2\bKukui: To