as. Reduces the damage the party receives for five turns."bA G-Max Move used by G-Max Machamp. Boosts the chance of critical hits for all ally Pokémon."UA G-Max Move used by G-Max Gengar. Prevents all opposing Pokémon from escaping."jA G-Max Move used by G-Max Grimmsnarl. May lull the target into falling asleep on its following turn."KA G-Max Move used by G-Max Eevee. May infatuate all opposing Pokémon."eA G-Max Move used by G-Max Melmetal. Prevents opponents from using the same move twice in a row."VA G-Max Move used by G-Max Urshifu. This single-strike move can ignore Max Guard."UA G-Max Move used by G-Max Urshifu. This rapid-strike move can ignore Max Guard.0000000000000"'Sygna Suit Brock's signature move."'Sygna Suit Misty's signature move."'Sygna Suit Erika's signature move."%Sygna Suit Red's signature move."3Sygna Suit Red (Thunderbolt)'s signature move."'Sygna Suit Morty's signature move."'Sygna Suit Ethan's signature move."&Sygna Suit Lyra's signature move.">The user raises its allies' Special Attack and Crit Rate."(Sygna Suit Silver's signature move."OThe user raises its allies' Special Attack, Special Defense and Crit Rate."JThe user raises its attack and accuracy and raises its allies' Speed."`The user sharple raises its Defense, Sp. Atk. Sp. Def. and Speed, while changing its moves."kThe user changes into Attack Forme and maxes out its Sp. Atk. and Crit Rate, while changing its moves."|The user changes into Speed Forme and maxes out its Speed and drastically raises its Evasion, while changing its moves."�The user changes into Defense Forme, guards itself and drastically raises all allies' Atk. and Sp. Atk., while changing its moves."'Sygna Suit Wally's signature move."'Sygna Suit Cyrus's signature move.")Sygna Suit Cynthia's signature move."4Sygna Suit Cynthia (Renegade)'s signature move."0Sygna Suit Cynthia (Aura)'s signature move."&Sygna Suit Dawn's signature move."'Sygna Suit Elesa's signature move."*Sygna Suit Grimsley's signature move."'Sygna Suit 