m weaker to Fairy attacks."jThe user fires a beam of light at its target. The type changes depending on the Drive the user holds."pLetting out a noble roar, the user intimidates the target and sharply lowers its Attack, Sp. Atk and Speed."�The user whips up a storm of diamonds to damage foes. This sharply raises all allies' Defense stat and shaprly lowers all opponent's Defense stat."^A Hydro Pump that is fueled by burned Pokémon. Lysandre and Volcanion's ultimate weapon."�The user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which harshly lowers their Speed stat and sharply raises ally Pokémon's Speed."cThe user tears at the target with blades formed by psychic power. Always lands a critical hit."�A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. It sharply raises all allies' Attack stat and makes all allies deal more damage with their next physical attack."0It enables all allies to evade all attacks."YA consecutive three-kick attack that becomes more powerful with each successful hit."_It swamps the area around the user with a giant sludge wave. It may also poison those hit."CAttacks opposing Pokémon by twanging a guitar or bass guitar."}The user unleashes a strong beam. The attack does more damage based on how much the opponent's Sp. Atk stat has been lowered."XThis relentless attack does massive damage to a target affected by status problems."EThe user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its foe."gThe user charges up power and raises both its Defense and Sp. Def. The move can be used two times."VThe power stored using the move Stockpile is absorbed by the user to heal its HP."uThe user crunches up the target with sharp fangs. It also lowers the target's Defense and Special Defense stats.000000000000000000000000000000"iThe user lunges at the target at a speed that makes it almost invisible. It is sure to strike first."ZBy moving rapidly, the user makes illusory copies of itself to raise its evasiveness."XThe user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. It causes flinching."|The user kicks the target with lightning-like movement. It drastically lowers the target's Defense and Special Defense."fThe user shoots its psychic power from its eyes to attack. This may also leave the target frozen."_The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. It may also freeze the target solid."]The user lands and rests its body. It restores the user's HP by up to 60% of its max HP."SThe user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the foe. It may burn the target."/The user rampages and attacks all enemies."XAn ancient song appeals to the hearts of those listening. It may also induce sleep."XLarge boulders are hurled at the foes to inflict damage, making the targets flinch."aThe user attacks with a gust of chilled air. It also harshly lowers the targets' Speed stat."hThe user attacks by slicing with its long horns. The target's stat changes don't affect the damage."jThe user attacks opposing Pokémon with countless beams of light that glow a deep and brilliant blue."`The user attacks its foes by manifesting the power of the land in fearsome blades of stone."iThe user slams into the target with the force of a meteor. Can't be stopped by the target's Ability."dThe user emits a sinister ray. This move can be used on the target regardless of its Abilities.000000000000000000000000000000000"'Arc Suit Cynthia's signature move."&Arc Suit Steven's signature move."%Arc Suit Lance's signature move."$Arc Suit Leon's signature move."!Arc Suit N's signature move."%Arc Suit Alder's signature move."&Arc Suit Silver's signature move."%Arc Suit Ethan's signature move."$Arc Suit Blue's signature move."%Arc Suit Brock's signature move."%Arc Suit Misty's signature move.000000000"EThe user sets off an earthquake that strikes all enemy Pokémon."EThe user sets off an earthquake that strikes all enemy Pokémon."dThe user strikes the target with tough punches as fast as bullets. This move always goes first."=The target is hit with a hard punch fired like a meteor.".The foe is attacked with a powerful beam."UThe user rampages, doing more damage the more the opponent's Sp. Def is lowered."lThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire. It also leaves the target with a burn."EThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire."lThe user lets loose a pitch-black shock wave at its target. It lowers the target's accuracy by 1 stage."gThe user lets loose a pitch-black shock wave at its target. It lowers the target's stats 10 times."=The foe is attacked with a powerful beam. Sets Bug Zone."yThe user vibrates its wings to generate a damaging sound wave, increasing the power of the user's next special move."hThe target is razed with a mystical fire of great intensity. It also leaves the target with a burn."zThe target is razed with a mystical fire of great intensity. Protects the user from damage from the rest of the turn."TA vortex of air is shot at the target to inflict damage. Always a critical hit."=A vortex of air is shot at the target to inflict damage."bThe user wraps its foe in a fierce wind that flies up into the sky. It also confuses the foe."_The user attacks with a blade of air that slices even the sky. It makes the target flinch."bThe user wraps its foe in a fierce wind that flies up into the sky. It also confuses the foe."bLarge boulders are hurled at the foes to inflict damage. It may also make the targets flinch."bThe user stabs the foe with sharpened stones from below. It always results in a critical hit."=Large boulders are hurled at the foes to inflict damage."^A spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at the target. It may also lower its Speed stat."SThe target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure."^A spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at the target. It may also lower its Speed stat.[0"
